[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

; One variable: the `visibility_parent` of a node that declares a `type=` under a path inside an
; instanced `.glb`, written as a `%Name`. Godot gives such a node the path `Body/Rig/Torso/<name>`
; and the instancing scene's owner, so `%ProxyDrawn` and `%ProxyHidden` resolve in this file's
; table. The red box names the proxy the camera is past the begin of, which draws, so the box hides.
; The green box names the proxy short of its begin, which hides, so the box draws. Resolved nowhere,
; both boxes draw.

